      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Battle of Five Forks, a decisive Civil War engagement, was fought near Wilsons, highlighting the area's strategic importance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
